DESCRIPTION:Catalina Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/011-120362\
 n\nIOLS\, Position-Specific Leader Training\n\nReady to complete your out
 door training for Scouts BSA being a Scout Master or Assistant Scout Mast
 er? Join us for Introduction to Outdoor Leader Skills (IOLS)\, a hands-on
  weekend designed to teach the outdoor skills every leader needs to deliv
 er a successful troop program.\nCheck-in is Friday at 5:00 PM - 5:30 PM\n
 Participants will learn and practice:\n•  Camping skills\n•  Fire b
 uilding and cooking\n•  Knots and lashings\n•  Map and compass\n•
