SUMMARY:2027 Camp Geronimo Summer Camp – Session 1
LOCATION:Camp Geronimo\, Payson\, Arizona
DESCRIPTION:Grand Canyon Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/010-ger
 onimo2027\n\n\n\nCamp Geronimo is located north of Payson in the shadows 
 of the magnificent Mogollon Rim on nearly 500 acres of forest and meadows
 . Surrounded by over 5\,000 acres of ponderosa pine forest\, trails lea
 d from camp to the top of the rim where Scouts can stand at the very ed
 ge of the Colorado Plateau.\nPlease reach out with\nany\nquestions\, comm
 ents\, or concerns. (602) 955-7747 | gcc.program@scoutingaz.org\nContact\
 nWhen & Where\nSave A Spot Registration\nSession 1\nCamp Geronimo\nSunday
  06-06-2027 1:00 PM MST
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/010-geronimo2027
END:VEVENT
